WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,190
Well, if you want to scream, that's not impossible, so forget it.

2
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:14,490
I want to live with these people

3
00:00:14,490 --> 00:00:19,580
No matter what we have to face, the window frame has been under pressure for a while, no matter what it will become

4
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:23,580
When I woke up in this body two years ago, I knew nothing about the world.

5
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:30,380
It was Li Weian who reached out to me in the hospital and took me back to school, where I met Yu Hui and Xiao Lin.

6
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:33,380
Yu Hui, you are afraid of Qing Shui, right?

7
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:43,990
No, I'm afraid that if I'm useless, Zhu Dingsan will abandon me.

8
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:51,500
Will you just leave me where I am? Why didn't I realize that I was so cold-blooded before?
